  <CBF_P_AtWallTip>該部件希望貼緊城牆的程度。必需強制接觸，禁止排除。沒有自有值時，採用類別的貼牆設定。</CBF_P_AtWallTip>
  <!-- EN: How often this piece is drawn when several fit. Empty takes the weight of the category. -->
  <CBF_P_WeightTip>多個部件適配時該部件被選中的頻率。留空則取類別的權重。</CBF_P_WeightTip>
  <!-- EN: Forbidden -->
  <CBF_Tend_Forbidden>禁止</CBF_Tend_Forbidden>
