  <CBF_AnchorConnect_Annex>生成器在此附加附屬建築。在房屋上錨點位於外牆，在附屬建築上位於共用牆或形狀外一格。</CBF_AnchorConnect_Annex>
  <!-- EN: No shared wall: placed on wall cells, no other building docks here. For window sides or facades. Several along one side block the whole side. Can be used several times. -->
  <CBF_AnchorConnect_NoShare>無共享牆：放置在牆體格上，其他建築不在此停靠。用於窗側或立面。同側多個會整側封死。可多次使用。</CBF_AnchorConnect_NoShare>
  <!-- EN: Marks the water side of a harbor piece. The generator only places the piece where these cells lie on water. -->
  <CBF_AnchorConnect_Water>標記港口部件的水邊。生成器只在這些格位於水面上時放置該部件。</CBF_AnchorConnect_Water>
